{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017wdN6wQ3w7oZeMe9UpGFxZ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"Phase 2 三方法对比 (GPT2-125M, WikiText-103, seed=42)\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"Self-iterate GPT2-125M × 8 gens × 3 methods (uncurated/RGDS/external_only)。 主实验验证 alignment gap 存在、外部嵌入相对免疫、内部选择加速崩塌。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"rgds\": {\n7\t        \"gen0_ppl\": 37.2,\n8\t        \"gen1_ppl\": 41.8,\n9\t        \"gen2_ppl\": 46.5,\n10\t        \"gen3_ppl\": 50.1,\n11\t        \"gen4_ppl\": 51.8,\n12\t        \"gen5_ppl\": 53.2,\n13\t        \"gen6_ppl\": 53.8,\n14\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 54.2,\n15\t        \"gen0_rare\": 0.029,\n16\t        \"gen1_rare\": 0.018,\n17\t        \"gen2_rare\": 0.012,\n18\t        \"gen3_rare\": 0.009,\n19\t        \"gen4_rare\": 0.008,\n20\t        \"gen5_rare\": 0.007,\n21\t        \"gen6_rare\": 0.0065,\n22\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.006,\n23\t        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.03,\n24\t        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 0.98,\n25\t        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 0.93,\n26\t        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 0.87,\n27\t        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 0.91,\n28\t        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 0.84,\n29\t        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 0.8,\n30\t        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.76,\n31\t        \"gen0_rankme\": 281,\n32\t        \"gen1_rankme\": 296,\n33\t        \"gen2_rankme\": 301,\n34\t        \"gen3_rankme\": 305,\n35\t        \"gen4_rankme\": 303,\n36\t        \"gen5_rankme\": 299,\n37\t        \"gen6_rankme\": 295,\n38\t        \"gen7_rankme\": 292,\n39\t        \"gen0_knn\": 0.988,\n40\t        \"gen7_knn\": 0.988,\n41\t        \"gen0_rank_corr\": -0.024,\n42\t        \"gen1_rank_corr\": -0.042,\n43\t        \"gen2_rank_corr\": -0.056,\n44\t        \"gen3_rank_corr\": -0.069,\n45\t        \"gen4_rank_corr\": -0.063,\n46\t        \"gen5_rank_corr\": -0.072,\n47\t        \"gen6_rank_corr\": -0.081,\n48\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.09\n49\t      },\n50\t      \"uncurated\": {\n51\t        \"gen0_ppl\": 37.0,\n52\t        \"gen1_ppl\": 44.8,\n53\t        \"gen2_ppl\": 51.5,\n54\t        \"gen3_ppl\": 56.8,\n55\t        \"gen4_ppl\": 55.5,\n56\t        \"gen5_ppl\": 51.6,\n57\t        \"gen6_ppl\": 48.5,\n58\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 48.0,\n59\t        \"gen0_rare\": 0.029,\n60\t        \"gen1_rare\": 0.019,\n61\t        \"gen2_rare\": 0.014,\n62\t        \"gen3_rare\": 0.012,\n63\t        \"gen4_rare\": 0.01,\n64\t        \"gen5_rare\": 0.01,\n65\t        \"gen6_rare\": 0.009,\n66\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.009,\n67\t        \"gen0_rankme\": 280,\n68\t        \"gen1_rankme\": 298,\n69\t        \"gen2_rankme\": 303,\n70\t        \"gen3_rankme\": 304,\n71\t        \"gen4_rankme\": 301,\n72\t        \"gen5_rankme\": 297,\n73\t        \"gen6_rankme\": 293,\n74\t        \"gen7_rankme\": 290,\n75\t        \"gen0_knn\": 0.988,\n76\t        \"gen7_knn\": 0.988,\n77\t        \"gen0_rank_corr\": -0.023,\n78\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.085\n79\t      },\n80\t      \"external_only\": {\n81\t        \"gen0_ppl\": 36.9,\n82\t        \"gen1_ppl\": 43.2,\n83\t        \"gen2_ppl\": 48.8,\n84\t        \"gen3_ppl\": 52.5,\n85\t        \"gen4_ppl\": 51.4,\n86\t        \"gen5_ppl\": 48.9,\n87\t        \"gen6_ppl\": 46.5,\n88\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 46.2,\n89\t        \"gen0_rare\": 0.029,\n90\t        \"gen1_rare\": 0.019,\n91\t        \"gen2_rare\": 0.014,\n92\t        \"gen3_rare\": 0.011,\n93\t        \"gen4_rare\": 0.01,\n94\t        \"gen5_rare\": 0.009,\n95\t        \"gen6_rare\": 0.008,\n96\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.008,\n97\t        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.05,\n98\t        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 1.06,\n99\t        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 1.04,\n100\t        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 1.03,\n101\t        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 1.02,\n102\t        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 1.01,\n103\t        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 1.0,\n104\t        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.99,\n105\t        \"gen0_rankme\": 282,\n106\t        \"gen1_rankme\": 296,\n107\t        \"gen2_rankme\": 302,\n108\t        \"gen3_rankme\": 304,\n109\t        \"gen4_rankme\": 302,\n110\t        \"gen5_rankme\": 298,\n111\t        \"gen6_rankme\": 294,\n112\t        \"gen7_rankme\": 291,\n113\t        \"gen0_knn\": 0.988,\n114\t        \"gen7_knn\": 0.988,\n115\t        \"gen0_rank_corr\": -0.024,\n116\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.053\n117\t      },\n118\t      \"derived_metrics\": {\n119\t        \"rgds_ppl_excess_vs_uncurated_pct\": 12.9,\n120\t        \"rgds_rare_deficit_vs_uncurated_pct\": -33.3,\n121\t        \"external_ppl_improvement_vs_uncurated_pct\": -3.8,\n122\t        \"external_rare_vs_uncurated_pct\": -11.1,\n123\t        \"internal_ratio_overall_delta\": -0.27,\n124\t        \"internal_ratio_monotonic\": false,\n125\t        \"internal_ratio_rebound_gens\": [\n126\t          4\n127\t        ],\n128\t        \"external_ratio_all_above_095\": true\n129\t      }\n130\t    },\n131\t    \"tables\": [\n132\t      {\n133\t        \"name\": \"Table 1: Main Results — PPL, Rare N-gram, Selection Ratio across Methods and Generations\",\n134\t        \"description\": \"8 行（gen0-7）× 3 methods × 4 指标（PPL, rare, selection_ratio, rank_corr）。 Highlight：internal ratio gen4 反弹行用 † 标注。末行加 Δ(gen0→gen7) 汇总。\\n\"\n135\t      },\n136\t      {\n137\t        \"name\": \"Table 2: Derived Comparison Metrics at Gen 7\",\n138\t        \"description\": \"对比 RGDS vs uncurated vs external 的 PPL excess %、rare deficit %、 selection ratio 终值。3×3 紧凑表格。\\n\"\n139\t      }\n140\t    ],\n141\t    \"figures\": [],\n142\t    \"analysis\": \"C1 成立但需弱化：internal ratio 整体下降趋势清晰（Δ=-0.27），但 gen4 反弹破坏了 \\\"monotonic\\\" 叙事。论文措辞改为 \\\"overall declining trend with transient recovery\\\"， 并在讨论中解释反弹的可能机制（训练中期 PPL plateau 导致嵌入空间短暂解压）。 C2-weak 稳固：external ratio 全程 >0.95，PPL 比 uncurated 好 3.8%。 但 rare n-gram 不优于 uncurated（甚至略差 11%），确认 C2 只能做弱声明。 C3 方向正确但 effect size 有限：RGDS PPL excess 仅 12.9%，不是 +49% 的强信号。 S1 和 S2 成为亮点：PPL-rare 解耦和 RankMe 失灵都是清晰的 measurement dissociation。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 internal selection ratio 整体从 1.03 降至 0.76（终值在 0.65-0.85 范围）， 但 gen4 出现一次反弹（0.87→0.91），打破严格单调性。这源于 self-iterate 中期模型 在 PPL 降低后嵌入空间发生短暂重组——gen3-4 PPL plateau 使嵌入分布暂时解压， selection ratio 短暂恢复，但后续代际训练继续压缩嵌入空间。 RGDS gen7 PPL 54.2 比 uncurated 48.0 高 12.9%，在 5-20% 范围内，说明内部选择 确实加速了崩塌但幅度有限。External ratio 全程 >0.95（终值 0.99），验证 C2-weak。 关键发现：external PPL 改善 3.8% 但 rare n-gram 仅比 uncurated 差 11%—— PPL 和 rare 的解耦（S1）在此清晰可见。 rank_corr 从 -0.024 到 -0.090，Δ=0.066，方向正确但幅度小于理想预期。 RankMe 从 281 上升到 292（一度达 305），与 rare n-gram 从 0.029 降至 0.006 形成鲜明反差——S2（RankMe 失灵）信号强。\\n\"\n143\t  },\n144\t  {\n145\t    \"name\": \"External_only seed=123 复现 (GPT2-125M, WikiText-103)\",\n146\t    \"description\": \"验证 external_only selection ratio >0.95 的可复现性。seed=123 单独跑 external arm。\\n\",\n147\t    \"results\": {\n148\t      \"external_only\": {\n149\t        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.04,\n150\t        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 1.05,\n151\t        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 1.03,\n152\t        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 1.02,\n153\t        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 1.01,\n154\t        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 1.0,\n155\t        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 0.99,\n156\t        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.98,\n157\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 46.5,\n158\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.008,\n159\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.051\n160\t      }\n161\t    },\n162\t    \"tables\": [],\n163\t    \"figures\": [],\n164\t    \"analysis\": \"确认 external selection ratio >0.95 在不同 seed 下可复现。数据合并到 plan_004 的完整 seed=123 结果中。\\n\\n\\nExternal ratio 在 seed=123 下仍全程 >0.95，终值 0.98（略低于 seed=42 的 0.99， 属正常 seed 变异）。Contriever 嵌入冻结不受训练反馈影响，其几何多样性评分 与内容多样性的对齐关系保持稳定。PPL 和 rare 与 seed=42 一致——external 选择 改善 PPL 但不改善 rare。此实验提供 C2-weak 的初步跨 seed 验证。\\n\"\n165\t  },\n166\t  {\n167\t    \"name\": \"三方法 seed=123 完整复现 (GPT2-125M, WikiText-103)\",\n168\t    \"description\": \"3 methods × 8 gens, seed=123。验证 alignment gap ratio 衰减趋势和 RGDS 加速崩塌的可复现性。\\n\",\n169\t    \"results\": {\n170\t      \"rgds\": {\n171\t        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.01,\n172\t        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 0.97,\n173\t        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 0.94,\n174\t        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 0.89,\n175\t        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 0.86,\n176\t        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 0.88,\n177\t        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 0.82,\n178\t        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.78,\n179\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 55.1,\n180\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.006,\n181\t        \"gen7_rankme\": 294,\n182\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.084,\n183\t        \"rebound_gens\": [\n184\t          5\n185\t        ]\n186\t      },\n187\t      \"uncurated\": {\n188\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 48.5,\n189\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.008,\n190\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.082\n191\t      },\n192\t      \"external_only\": {\n193\t        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.98,\n194\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 46.5,\n195\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.008,\n196\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.051\n197\t      },\n198\t      \"derived_metrics\": {\n199\t        \"rgds_ppl_excess_vs_uncurated_pct\": 13.6,\n200\t        \"internal_ratio_monotonic\": false,\n201\t        \"internal_ratio_rebound_gens\": [\n202\t          5\n203\t        ],\n204\t        \"cross_seed_internal_ratio_gen7_vs_seed42\": 0.02\n205\t      }\n206\t    },\n207\t    \"tables\": [\n208\t      {\n209\t        \"name\": \"Table 3 (appendix): Seed=123 Full Trajectory\",\n210\t        \"description\": \"与 Table 1 格式相同的完整 gen0-7 轨迹，用于 appendix 展示可复现性。\\n\"\n211\t      }\n212\t    ],\n213\t    \"figures\": [],\n214\t    \"analysis\": \"C1 跨 seed 可复现性确认：两个 seed 都显示 internal ratio 整体下降（Δ≈-0.23 到 -0.27）， 但反弹位置不同（gen4 vs gen5），进一步支持弱化 \\\"monotonic\\\" 为 \\\"overall trend\\\"。 C2-weak 稳固复现。RGDS PPL excess 跨 seed 一致（12.9% vs 13.6%）。\\n\\n\\nSeed=123 复现了 alignment gap 的整体趋势但反弹发生在 gen5（seed=42 在 gen4）， 终值 0.78 比 seed=42 的 0.76 略高。这属于正常 seed 变异——不同初始化导致 嵌入空间压缩的具体轨迹略有不同，但整体方向一致。RGDS PPL excess 13.6% 与 seed=42 的 12.9% 接近。关键发现：反弹位置的不一致说明 \\\"monotonic\\\" 声明不可持续，但 \\\"overall declining trend\\\" 在两个 seed 间一致。 External ratio 终值 0.98，PPL 和 rare 模式与 seed=42 高度一致。\\n\"\n215\t  },\n216\t  {\n217\t    \"name\": \"三方法 seed=456 完整复现 (GPT2-125M, WikiText-103)\",\n218\t    \"description\": \"3 methods × 8 gens, seed=456。第三个种子，满足统计检验最低要求（3 seeds）。\\n\",\n219\t    \"results\": {\n220\t      \"rgds\": {\n221\t        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.05,\n222\t        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 1.0,\n223\t        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 0.96,\n224\t        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 0.9,\n225\t        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 0.87,\n226\t        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 0.83,\n227\t        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 0.85,\n228\t        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.8,\n229\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 53.8,\n230\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.007,\n231\t        \"gen7_rankme\": 293,\n232\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.078,\n233\t        \"rebound_gens\": [\n234\t          6\n235\t        ]\n236\t      },\n237\t      \"uncurated\": {\n238\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 47.8,\n239\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.009,\n240\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.08\n241\t      },\n242\t      \"external_only\": {\n243\t        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 1.0,\n244\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 45.8,\n245\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.008,\n246\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.049\n247\t      },\n248\t      \"derived_metrics\": {\n249\t        \"rgds_ppl_excess_vs_uncurated_pct\": 12.6\n250\t      },\n251\t      \"cross_seed_summary_3seeds\": {\n252\t        \"internal_ratio_gen7_mean\": 0.78,\n253\t        \"internal_ratio_gen7_std\": 0.02,\n254\t        \"external_ratio_gen7_mean\": 0.99,\n255\t        \"external_ratio_gen7_std\": 0.01,\n256\t        \"rgds_ppl_excess_mean_pct\": 13.0,\n257\t        \"rgds_ppl_excess_std_pct\": 0.5,\n258\t        \"rgds_rare_gen7_mean\": 0.0063,\n259\t        \"rgds_rare_gen7_std\": 0.0006,\n260\t        \"uncurated_rare_gen7_mean\": 0.0087,\n261\t        \"uncurated_rare_gen7_std\": 0.0005,\n262\t        \"rank_corr_delta_internal_mean\": -0.06,\n263\t        \"rank_corr_delta_internal_std\": 0.008,\n264\t        \"paired_t_test_internal_vs_external_ratio_p\": 0.003,\n265\t        \"paired_t_test_rgds_vs_uncurated_ppl_p\": 0.02,\n266\t        \"paired_t_test_rgds_vs_uncurated_rare_p\": 0.04\n267\t      }\n268\t    },\n269\t    \"tables\": [\n270\t      {\n271\t        \"name\": \"Table 3: Cross-Seed Summary Statistics (GPT2-125M, 3 seeds)\",\n272\t        \"description\": \"汇总 3 seeds 的 gen7 关键指标：mean±std + p-value。 internal ratio, external ratio, PPL excess, rare deficit, rank_corr delta。 粗体标注 p<0.05 的行。\\n\"\n273\t      }\n274\t    ],\n275\t    \"figures\": [],\n276\t    \"analysis\": \"三 seed 汇总后 C1 的统计基础确立：internal ratio 下降显著（p=0.003）， 但 \\\"monotonic\\\" 声明不可用（三个 seed 反弹位置各异）。 C3 可用但需附 effect size：PPL excess 13.0%（Cohen's d ≈ 1.8，大效应量， 但绝对值不如原始 framing 的 49%），rare deficit 30%（p=0.04，边缘显著）。 C2-weak 是最强的 claim：external ratio 跨 seed 高度一致，p 极显著。 这个汇总表是论文核心 Table，需要放在正文而非 appendix。\\n\\n\\nSeed=456 的反弹出现在 gen6（三个 seed 分别在 gen4/5/6 反弹），终值 0.80。 三个 seed 汇总：internal ratio gen7 均值 0.78±0.02，external 0.99±0.01， 差异显著（paired t-test p=0.003）。RGDS PPL excess 均值 13.0±0.5%， 虽然绝对值不大但跨 seed 一致，p=0.02 显著。 关键 median 特征：rare n-gram 差异 p=0.04——勉强显著（p<0.05 但非 p<0.01）， 这是 median 档的典型表现。rank_corr delta 均值仅 -0.060±0.008， 效应量小但方向一致。三个 seed 都有反弹但位置不同，支持 \\\"overall trend\\\" 叙事但无法声称 \\\"monotonic\\\"。\\n\"\n277\t  },\n278\t  {\n279\t    \"name\": \"GPT2-medium 355M 三方法对比 (WikiText-103, seed=42)\",\n280\t    \"description\": \"验证 alignment gap 在更大模型规模上存在。回应审稿人 \\\"GPT2-125M 太小\\\" 的预期质疑。\\n\",\n281\t    \"results\": {\n282\t      \"rgds\": {\n283\t        \"gen0_ppl\": 29.3,\n284\t        \"gen1_ppl\": 33.5,\n285\t        \"gen2_ppl\": 37.2,\n286\t        \"gen3_ppl\": 40.1,\n287\t        \"gen4_ppl\": 41.5,\n288\t        \"gen5_ppl\": 42.3,\n289\t        \"gen6_ppl\": 42.8,\n290\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 43.2,\n291\t        \"gen0_rare\": 0.031,\n292\t        \"gen1_rare\": 0.021,\n293\t        \"gen2_rare\": 0.015,\n294\t        \"gen3_rare\": 0.012,\n295\t        \"gen4_rare\": 0.01,\n296\t        \"gen5_rare\": 0.009,\n297\t        \"gen6_rare\": 0.008,\n298\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.007,\n299\t        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.02,\n300\t        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 0.98,\n301\t        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 0.95,\n302\t        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 0.9,\n303\t        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 0.88,\n304\t        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 0.86,\n305\t        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 0.83,\n306\t        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.8,\n307\t        \"gen0_rankme\": 340,\n308\t        \"gen1_rankme\": 355,\n309\t        \"gen2_rankme\": 362,\n310\t        \"gen3_rankme\": 368,\n311\t        \"gen4_rankme\": 366,\n312\t        \"gen5_rankme\": 361,\n313\t        \"gen6_rankme\": 356,\n314\t        \"gen7_rankme\": 352,\n315\t        \"gen0_rank_corr\": -0.02,\n316\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.076,\n317\t        \"rebound_gens\": []\n318\t      },\n319\t      \"uncurated\": {\n320\t        \"gen0_ppl\": 29.0,\n321\t        \"gen1_ppl\": 34.8,\n322\t        \"gen2_ppl\": 39.5,\n323\t        \"gen3_ppl\": 43.2,\n324\t        \"gen4_ppl\": 42.5,\n325\t        \"gen5_ppl\": 40.1,\n326\t        \"gen6_ppl\": 38.2,\n327\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 37.8,\n328\t        \"gen0_rare\": 0.031,\n329\t        \"gen1_rare\": 0.021,\n330\t        \"gen2_rare\": 0.016,\n331\t        \"gen3_rare\": 0.013,\n332\t        \"gen4_rare\": 0.011,\n333\t        \"gen5_rare\": 0.011,\n334\t        \"gen6_rare\": 0.01,\n335\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.01,\n336\t        \"gen0_rankme\": 342,\n337\t        \"gen7_rankme\": 354,\n338\t        \"gen0_rank_corr\": -0.019,\n339\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.072\n340\t      },\n341\t      \"external_only\": {\n342\t        \"gen0_ppl\": 28.8,\n343\t        \"gen1_ppl\": 33.8,\n344\t        \"gen2_ppl\": 38.0,\n345\t        \"gen3_ppl\": 41.0,\n346\t        \"gen4_ppl\": 40.2,\n347\t        \"gen5_ppl\": 38.5,\n348\t        \"gen6_ppl\": 36.8,\n349\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 36.5,\n350\t        \"gen0_rare\": 0.031,\n351\t        \"gen1_rare\": 0.021,\n352\t        \"gen2_rare\": 0.015,\n353\t        \"gen3_rare\": 0.012,\n354\t        \"gen4_rare\": 0.011,\n355\t        \"gen5_rare\": 0.01,\n356\t        \"gen6_rare\": 0.009,\n357\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.009,\n358\t        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.04,\n359\t        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.98,\n360\t        \"gen0_rank_corr\": -0.019,\n361\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.048\n362\t      },\n363\t      \"derived_metrics\": {\n364\t        \"rgds_ppl_excess_vs_uncurated_pct\": 14.3,\n365\t        \"rgds_rare_deficit_vs_uncurated_pct\": -30.0,\n366\t        \"internal_ratio_delta\": -0.22,\n367\t        \"internal_ratio_monotonic\": true,\n368\t        \"note\": \"GPT2-medium 无反弹但斜率更平缓\"\n369\t      }\n370\t    },\n371\t    \"tables\": [\n372\t      {\n373\t        \"name\": \"Table 4: GPT2-medium Results — Cross-Scale Comparison\",\n374\t        \"description\": \"GPT2-125M vs GPT2-medium 的 gen7 指标并列对比。 重点：ratio Δ、PPL excess %、rare deficit % 跨规模一致性。\\n\"\n375\t      }\n376\t    ],\n377\t    \"figures\": [],\n378\t    \"analysis\": \"GPT2-medium 确认 alignment gap 跨模型规模存在（R1 reviewer concern 回应）。 但 median 档下需要注意：medium 只有 1 seed，且轨迹比 125M \\\"更好看\\\"（无反弹）， 这可能是 cherry-picking 的风险。论文中需诚实报告 125M 有反弹而 medium 没有， 并解释为模型容量差异。跨规模 PPL excess 一致性（13% vs 14%）是强证据。 medium 的 self-recovery 更强（uncurated PPL 从峰值 43.2 回落到 37.8）， 这可能暗示更大模型的 alignment gap 效应在后期代际会被部分抵消—— 但 rare n-gram 仍然持续下降，再次印证 S1（PPL 和 rare 度量不同崩塌维度）。\\n\\n\\nGPT2-medium 的 alignment gap 效应量略小于 125M（ratio Δ=-0.22 vs -0.27）， 但仍然清晰。更大的模型容量使嵌入空间有更多维度可压缩，压缩过程更平缓， 因此没有出现 125M 的反弹现象——这实际上是好消息，因为 medium 的轨迹 更接近 \\\"monotonic\\\"（但只有一个 seed，不能过度声明）。 PPL excess 14.3% 与 125M 的 13.0% 接近，说明 alignment gap 的相对效应 跨模型规模一致。Rare n-gram 下降幅度也相似（-30% vs -33%）。 RankMe 基线更高（340 vs 281，符合更大模型预期）但同样与 rare 反向变动。 关键限制：uncurated gen7 PPL 37.8 比 gen0 的 29.0 高 30%，说明 self-iterate 崩塌在 medium 上也存在，只是 PPL 最终回落更多（medium 的 self-recovery 更强）。\\n\"\n379\t  },\n380\t  {\n381\t    \"name\": \"GPT2-medium 355M seed=123 复现\",\n382\t    \"description\": \"GPT2-medium 多 seed 验证，确认 355M 规模下 alignment gap 可复现。\\n\",\n383\t    \"results\": {\n384\t      \"rgds\": {\n385\t        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.82,\n386\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 44.0,\n387\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.007,\n388\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.072,\n389\t        \"rebound_gens\": [\n390\t          5\n391\t        ]\n392\t      },\n393\t      \"uncurated\": {\n394\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 38.5,\n395\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.01\n396\t      },\n397\t      \"external_only\": {\n398\t        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.97,\n399\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 37.2,\n400\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.009\n401\t      },\n402\t      \"derived_metrics\": {\n403\t        \"rgds_ppl_excess_vs_uncurated_pct\": 14.3,\n404\t        \"note\": \"seed=123 在 medium 上出现 gen5 微弱反弹（ratio 0.85→0.87），但整体趋势一致\"\n405\t      },\n406\t      \"cross_scale_cross_seed_summary\": {\n407\t        \"gpt2_125m_internal_ratio_gen7_mean_2seeds\": 0.77,\n408\t        \"gpt2_medium_internal_ratio_gen7_mean_2seeds\": 0.81,\n409\t        \"ratio_gap_between_scales\": 0.04,\n410\t        \"interpretation\": \"medium 终值略高但差异不大，alignment gap 跨规模稳健\"\n411\t      }\n412\t    },\n413\t    \"tables\": [\n414\t      {\n415\t        \"name\": \"Table 4 (扩展): 跨模型跨 seed 汇总\",\n416\t        \"description\": \"2 模型 × 2-3 seeds 的 gen7 关键指标矩阵。 标注哪些 seed 有反弹、反弹位置。\\n\"\n417\t      }\n418\t    ],\n419\t    \"figures\": [],\n420\t    \"analysis\": \"Medium 跨 seed 验证成功但样本量有限（只有 2 seeds vs 125M 的 3 seeds）。 论文中需注明 medium 实验为初步验证（\\\"preliminary evidence of scale generalization\\\"）， 不做过强声明。Combined evidence：5 个独立实验（125M×3 + medium×2）全部 显示 internal ratio 下降，终值范围 0.76-0.82，external 终值 0.97-1.00。 这足以支持 Findings paper。\\n\\n\\nSeed=123 在 medium 上出现一次微弱反弹（gen5，ratio +0.02）， 而 seed=42 无反弹——进一步说明反弹是 seed-dependent noise，不是系统性信号。 Medium 两 seed 内部 ratio 终值分别 0.80 和 0.82（125M 为 0.76 和 0.78）， 差异 ~0.04，说明更大模型的 gap 略小但方向一致。 PPL excess 14.3% 与 seed=42 完全一致，跨 seed 稳定性比 125M 更好 （可能因为 medium 训练更稳定）。\\n\"\n421\t  },\n422\t  {\n423\t    \"name\": \"Embedding re-anchoring 缓解实验 (GPT2-125M, seed=42)\",\n424\t    \"description\": \"每 K 代（K=3）用原始预训练权重重新计算选择嵌入（不改训练过程，只改 selection 用的嵌入）。 测试 alignment gap 是否可通过简单手段修复。\\n\",\n425\t    \"results\": {\n426\t      \"reanchored\": {\n427\t        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.03,\n428\t        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 0.98,\n429\t        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 0.93,\n430\t        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 1.01,\n431\t        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 0.96,\n432\t        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 0.91,\n433\t        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 0.98,\n434\t        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.93,\n435\t        \"gen0_ppl\": 37.2,\n436\t        \"gen1_ppl\": 41.8,\n437\t        \"gen2_ppl\": 46.5,\n438\t        \"gen3_ppl\": 49.8,\n439\t        \"gen4_ppl\": 51.3,\n440\t        \"gen5_ppl\": 52.1,\n441\t        \"gen6_ppl\": 50.5,\n442\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 51.8,\n443\t        \"gen0_rare\": 0.029,\n444\t        \"gen1_rare\": 0.018,\n445\t        \"gen2_rare\": 0.012,\n446\t        \"gen3_rare\": 0.01,\n447\t        \"gen4_rare\": 0.008,\n448\t        \"gen5_rare\": 0.007,\n449\t        \"gen6_rare\": 0.007,\n450\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.0065,\n451\t        \"gen0_rank_corr\": -0.024,\n452\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.082\n453\t      },\n454\t      \"comparison_vs_rgds\": {\n455\t        \"ppl_improvement_pct\": 4.4,\n456\t        \"rare_improvement_pct\": 8.3,\n457\t        \"selection_ratio_gen7_improvement\": 0.17\n458\t      },\n459\t      \"statistical_tests\": {\n460\t        \"ppl_diff_significant\": false,\n461\t        \"rare_diff_significant\": false,\n462\t        \"ratio_recovery_significant\": true,\n463\t        \"ppl_p_value\": 0.12,\n464\t        \"rare_p_value\": 0.31,\n465\t        \"note\": \"ratio 恢复显著但下游指标改善不显著\"\n466\t      }\n467\t    },\n468\t    \"tables\": [\n469\t      {\n470\t        \"name\": \"Table 5 (appendix): Re-anchoring vs RGDS vs Uncurated\",\n471\t        \"description\": \"三行（RGDS/re-anchored/uncurated）× gen7 关键指标 + p-value。 标注 re-anchored ratio 显著恢复但 PPL/rare 不显著。\\n\"\n472\t      }\n473\t    ],\n474\t    \"figures\": [],\n475\t    \"analysis\": \"Re-anchoring 产生了一个有趣但不足以升级论文的结果：ratio 恢复证明 alignment gap 确实是可诊断的（验证了 C1 的因果方向），但下游不改善说明 gap 只是崩塌链条的一环。 这个结果对 Findings paper 来说反而是好事——如果 re-anchoring 完全解决了问题， 审稿人会期望更大的实验矩阵；现在 re-anchoring 失败，\\\"开放问题\\\" 的定位更自然。 移入 appendix，1 段讨论 + 2 张 appendix 图。 论文正文加一句：\\\"Simple embedding re-anchoring restores selection ratio but does not translate to downstream diversity improvement (Appendix B), suggesting the root cause lies in the generation process rather than the selection process.\\\"\\n\\n\\nRe-anchoring 成功恢复了 selection ratio 的短期表现（每次 re-anchor 后 ratio 跳回 ~1.0），但恢复是暂时的——ratio 在每个 K-step 周期内又迅速下降。 终值 0.93 显著优于 RGDS 的 0.76（ratio 恢复显著），但下游指标改善有限： PPL 改善仅 4.4%（51.8 vs 54.2，p=0.12 不显著），rare 改善 8.3% （0.0065 vs 0.006，p=0.31 不显著）。\\n根本原因：re-anchoring 解决了\\\"用错误的嵌入选数据\\\"的问题（ratio 恢复）， 但没有解决\\\"self-iterate 训练本身导致模型生成同质化内容\\\"的根本问题。 选出的数据在 gen0 嵌入空间中看起来多样，但模型已经往同质化方向漂移， 再训练仍然会压缩嵌入空间。这就是为什么 ratio 能恢复但 rare 不能—— 问题在生成端（模型已经不会生成 rare tokens），不在选择端。\\nMedian 档预测 reanchoring_rare_improvement_pct 在 [-5, 10] 范围， 此处 8.3% 位于上界附近但 p>0.05，不具统计意义。\\n\"\n476\t  },\n477\t  {\n478\t    \"name\": \"OpenWebText 子集 三方法对比 (GPT2-125M, seed=42)\",\n479\t    \"description\": \"验证 alignment gap 跨数据集存在。回应 \\\"WikiText-103 是否特殊\\\" 的质疑。 使用 OpenWebText 随机 50K 子集。\\n\",\n480\t    \"results\": {\n481\t      \"rgds\": {\n482\t        \"gen0_ppl\": 28.5,\n483\t        \"gen1_ppl\": 32.8,\n484\t        \"gen2_ppl\": 37.1,\n485\t        \"gen3_ppl\": 40.3,\n486\t        \"gen4_ppl\": 42.0,\n487\t        \"gen5_ppl\": 43.1,\n488\t        \"gen6_ppl\": 43.6,\n489\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 44.0,\n490\t        \"gen0_rare\": 0.025,\n491\t        \"gen1_rare\": 0.016,\n492\t        \"gen2_rare\": 0.011,\n493\t        \"gen3_rare\": 0.008,\n494\t        \"gen4_rare\": 0.007,\n495\t        \"gen5_rare\": 0.006,\n496\t        \"gen6_rare\": 0.0055,\n497\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.005,\n498\t        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.04,\n499\t        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 0.99,\n500\t        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 0.94,\n501\t        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 0.88,\n502\t        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 0.85,\n503\t        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 0.82,\n504\t        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 0.79,\n505\t        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.74,\n506\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.095,\n507\t        \"rebound_gens\": []\n508\t      },\n509\t      \"uncurated\": {\n510\t        \"gen0_ppl\": 28.2,\n511\t        \"gen1_ppl\": 34.1,\n512\t        \"gen2_ppl\": 39.8,\n513\t        \"gen3_ppl\": 44.5,\n514\t        \"gen4_ppl\": 43.8,\n515\t        \"gen5_ppl\": 41.2,\n516\t        \"gen6_ppl\": 38.9,\n517\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 38.5,\n518\t        \"gen0_rare\": 0.025,\n519\t        \"gen1_rare\": 0.017,\n520\t        \"gen2_rare\": 0.012,\n521\t        \"gen3_rare\": 0.01,\n522\t        \"gen4_rare\": 0.009,\n523\t        \"gen5_rare\": 0.008,\n524\t        \"gen6_rare\": 0.008,\n525\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.007,\n526\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.081\n527\t      },\n528\t      \"external_only\": {\n529\t        \"gen0_ppl\": 27.9,\n530\t        \"gen1_ppl\": 33.0,\n531\t        \"gen2_ppl\": 38.2,\n532\t        \"gen3_ppl\": 41.5,\n533\t        \"gen4_ppl\": 40.8,\n534\t        \"gen5_ppl\": 38.9,\n535\t        \"gen6_ppl\": 37.0,\n536\t        \"gen7_ppl\": 36.8,\n537\t        \"gen0_rare\": 0.025,\n538\t        \"gen1_rare\": 0.016,\n539\t        \"gen2_rare\": 0.012,\n540\t        \"gen3_rare\": 0.01,\n541\t        \"gen4_rare\": 0.009,\n542\t        \"gen5_rare\": 0.008,\n543\t        \"gen6_rare\": 0.007,\n544\t        \"gen7_rare\": 0.007,\n545\t        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.06,\n546\t        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 1.01,\n547\t        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.05\n548\t      },\n549\t      \"derived_metrics\": {\n550\t        \"rgds_ppl_excess_vs_uncurated_pct\": 14.3,\n551\t        \"rgds_rare_deficit_vs_uncurated_pct\": -28.6,\n552\t        \"note\": \"OWT 基线 PPL 更低（GPT2 预训练数据包含 web text），rare 基线也更低（更标准化的文本）\"\n553\t      },\n554\t      \"cross_dataset_comparison\": {\n555\t        \"wikitext_rgds_ppl_excess_pct\": 13.0,\n556\t        \"owt_rgds_ppl_excess_pct\": 14.3,\n557\t        \"wikitext_internal_ratio_gen7\": 0.78,\n558\t        \"owt_internal_ratio_gen7\": 0.74,\n559\t        \"consistency\": \"方向和量级一致，OWT 上 gap 略大（可能因 OWT 文本更同质化）\"\n560\t      }\n561\t    },\n562\t    \"tables\": [\n563\t      {\n564\t        \"name\": \"Table 5: Cross-Dataset Comparison (WikiText-103 vs OpenWebText)\",\n565\t        \"description\": \"两数据集 gen7 指标并列：internal ratio, external ratio, PPL excess %, rare deficit %, rank_corr delta。最后一列标注一致性（✓/✗）。\\n\"\n566\t      }\n567\t    ],\n568\t    \"figures\": [],\n569\t    \"analysis\": \"OWT 验证是 median 档论文能否投 Findings 的关键实验之一。跨数据集一致性 直接回应 R2 reviewer concern。OWT 上 gap 略大这个发现本身可以讨论—— 更同质化的数据源可能让嵌入空间压缩更快。但因为 OWT 只有 1 seed， 不能做过强的跨数据集对比声明。论文中用 \\\"consistent pattern across both datasets\\\" 的措辞，不量化差异的显著性。 如果时间不够，这个实验是 P1 可以砍掉的——但砍掉后审稿人 R2 concern 会更难回应，论文可能降为 workshop paper。\\n\\nOpenWebText 上 alignment gap 同样存在，且效应量略大于 WikiText-103 （ratio 终值 0.74 vs 0.78，PPL excess 14.3% vs 13.0%）。OWT 没有反弹—— 这可能因为 OWT 文本分布本身更均匀（web crawl vs curated Wikipedia）， 导致嵌入空间压缩更平滑。OWT 基线 PPL 更低（28.2 vs 37.0）因为 GPT2 预训练数据包含大量 web text，domain 更接近。\\nRare n-gram 基线也更低（0.025 vs 0.029），反映 OWT 文本本身的词汇多样性 低于 WikiText（web text 更口语化，rare token 更少）。但 rare 的下降比例 与 WikiText 一致（-80% vs -79%），说明崩塌机制是数据集无关的。\\nExternal selection ratio 终值 1.01（WikiText 0.99），都在 >0.95 范围内。 跨数据集一致性是 Findings paper 的重要支撑——单数据集发现的可信度受限， 两个数据集的一致结果显著增强说服力。\\n\"\n570\t  }\n571\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0bbf4eb3-b4da-441c-9b01-1494e5d0d8cb","uuid":"5c0fecbe-6a98-4de0-a205-a5f2e8725b4e","timestamp":"2026-05-13T08:37:56.341Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T081019/median/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Phase 2 三方法对比 (GPT2-125M, WikiText-103, seed=42)\",\n    \"description\": \"Self-iterate GPT2-125M × 8 gens × 3 methods (uncurated/RGDS/external_only)。 主实验验证 alignment gap 存在、外部嵌入相对免疫、内部选择加速崩塌。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"rgds\": {\n        \"gen0_ppl\": 37.2,\n        \"gen1_ppl\": 41.8,\n        \"gen2_ppl\": 46.5,\n        \"gen3_ppl\": 50.1,\n        \"gen4_ppl\": 51.8,\n        \"gen5_ppl\": 53.2,\n        \"gen6_ppl\": 53.8,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 54.2,\n        \"gen0_rare\": 0.029,\n        \"gen1_rare\": 0.018,\n        \"gen2_rare\": 0.012,\n        \"gen3_rare\": 0.009,\n        \"gen4_rare\": 0.008,\n        \"gen5_rare\": 0.007,\n        \"gen6_rare\": 0.0065,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.006,\n        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.03,\n        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 0.98,\n        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 0.93,\n        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 0.87,\n        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 0.91,\n        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 0.84,\n        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 0.8,\n        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.76,\n        \"gen0_rankme\": 281,\n        \"gen1_rankme\": 296,\n        \"gen2_rankme\": 301,\n        \"gen3_rankme\": 305,\n        \"gen4_rankme\": 303,\n        \"gen5_rankme\": 299,\n        \"gen6_rankme\": 295,\n        \"gen7_rankme\": 292,\n        \"gen0_knn\": 0.988,\n        \"gen7_knn\": 0.988,\n        \"gen0_rank_corr\": -0.024,\n        \"gen1_rank_corr\": -0.042,\n        \"gen2_rank_corr\": -0.056,\n        \"gen3_rank_corr\": -0.069,\n        \"gen4_rank_corr\": -0.063,\n        \"gen5_rank_corr\": -0.072,\n        \"gen6_rank_corr\": -0.081,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.09\n      },\n      \"uncurated\": {\n        \"gen0_ppl\": 37.0,\n        \"gen1_ppl\": 44.8,\n        \"gen2_ppl\": 51.5,\n        \"gen3_ppl\": 56.8,\n        \"gen4_ppl\": 55.5,\n        \"gen5_ppl\": 51.6,\n        \"gen6_ppl\": 48.5,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 48.0,\n        \"gen0_rare\": 0.029,\n        \"gen1_rare\": 0.019,\n        \"gen2_rare\": 0.014,\n        \"gen3_rare\": 0.012,\n        \"gen4_rare\": 0.01,\n        \"gen5_rare\": 0.01,\n        \"gen6_rare\": 0.009,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.009,\n        \"gen0_rankme\": 280,\n        \"gen1_rankme\": 298,\n        \"gen2_rankme\": 303,\n        \"gen3_rankme\": 304,\n        \"gen4_rankme\": 301,\n        \"gen5_rankme\": 297,\n        \"gen6_rankme\": 293,\n        \"gen7_rankme\": 290,\n        \"gen0_knn\": 0.988,\n        \"gen7_knn\": 0.988,\n        \"gen0_rank_corr\": -0.023,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.085\n      },\n      \"external_only\": {\n        \"gen0_ppl\": 36.9,\n        \"gen1_ppl\": 43.2,\n        \"gen2_ppl\": 48.8,\n        \"gen3_ppl\": 52.5,\n        \"gen4_ppl\": 51.4,\n        \"gen5_ppl\": 48.9,\n        \"gen6_ppl\": 46.5,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 46.2,\n        \"gen0_rare\": 0.029,\n        \"gen1_rare\": 0.019,\n        \"gen2_rare\": 0.014,\n        \"gen3_rare\": 0.011,\n        \"gen4_rare\": 0.01,\n        \"gen5_rare\": 0.009,\n        \"gen6_rare\": 0.008,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.008,\n        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.05,\n        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 1.06,\n        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 1.04,\n        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 1.03,\n        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 1.02,\n        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 1.01,\n        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 1.0,\n        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.99,\n        \"gen0_rankme\": 282,\n        \"gen1_rankme\": 296,\n        \"gen2_rankme\": 302,\n        \"gen3_rankme\": 304,\n        \"gen4_rankme\": 302,\n        \"gen5_rankme\": 298,\n        \"gen6_rankme\": 294,\n        \"gen7_rankme\": 291,\n        \"gen0_knn\": 0.988,\n        \"gen7_knn\": 0.988,\n        \"gen0_rank_corr\": -0.024,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.053\n      },\n      \"derived_metrics\": {\n        \"rgds_ppl_excess_vs_uncurated_pct\": 12.9,\n        \"rgds_rare_deficit_vs_uncurated_pct\": -33.3,\n        \"external_ppl_improvement_vs_uncurated_pct\": -3.8,\n        \"external_rare_vs_uncurated_pct\": -11.1,\n        \"internal_ratio_overall_delta\": -0.27,\n        \"internal_ratio_monotonic\": false,\n        \"internal_ratio_rebound_gens\": [\n          4\n        ],\n        \"external_ratio_all_above_095\": true\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 1: Main Results — PPL, Rare N-gram, Selection Ratio across Methods and Generations\",\n        \"description\": \"8 行（gen0-7）× 3 methods × 4 指标（PPL, rare, selection_ratio, rank_corr）。 Highlight：internal ratio gen4 反弹行用 † 标注。末行加 Δ(gen0→gen7) 汇总。\\n\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 2: Derived Comparison Metrics at Gen 7\",\n        \"description\": \"对比 RGDS vs uncurated vs external 的 PPL excess %、rare deficit %、 selection ratio 终值。3×3 紧凑表格。\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C1 成立但需弱化：internal ratio 整体下降趋势清晰（Δ=-0.27），但 gen4 反弹破坏了 \\\"monotonic\\\" 叙事。论文措辞改为 \\\"overall declining trend with transient recovery\\\"， 并在讨论中解释反弹的可能机制（训练中期 PPL plateau 导致嵌入空间短暂解压）。 C2-weak 稳固：external ratio 全程 >0.95，PPL 比 uncurated 好 3.8%。 但 rare n-gram 不优于 uncurated（甚至略差 11%），确认 C2 只能做弱声明。 C3 方向正确但 effect size 有限：RGDS PPL excess 仅 12.9%，不是 +49% 的强信号。 S1 和 S2 成为亮点：PPL-rare 解耦和 RankMe 失灵都是清晰的 measurement dissociation。\\n\\n\\nMedian 档下 internal selection ratio 整体从 1.03 降至 0.76（终值在 0.65-0.85 范围）， 但 gen4 出现一次反弹（0.87→0.91），打破严格单调性。这源于 self-iterate 中期模型 在 PPL 降低后嵌入空间发生短暂重组——gen3-4 PPL plateau 使嵌入分布暂时解压， selection ratio 短暂恢复，但后续代际训练继续压缩嵌入空间。 RGDS gen7 PPL 54.2 比 uncurated 48.0 高 12.9%，在 5-20% 范围内，说明内部选择 确实加速了崩塌但幅度有限。External ratio 全程 >0.95（终值 0.99），验证 C2-weak。 关键发现：external PPL 改善 3.8% 但 rare n-gram 仅比 uncurated 差 11%—— PPL 和 rare 的解耦（S1）在此清晰可见。 rank_corr 从 -0.024 到 -0.090，Δ=0.066，方向正确但幅度小于理想预期。 RankMe 从 281 上升到 292（一度达 305），与 rare n-gram 从 0.029 降至 0.006 形成鲜明反差——S2（RankMe 失灵）信号强。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"External_only seed=123 复现 (GPT2-125M, WikiText-103)\",\n    \"description\": \"验证 external_only selection ratio >0.95 的可复现性。seed=123 单独跑 external arm。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"external_only\": {\n        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.04,\n        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 1.05,\n        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 1.03,\n        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 1.02,\n        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 1.01,\n        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 1.0,\n        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 0.99,\n        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.98,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 46.5,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.008,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.051\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"确认 external selection ratio >0.95 在不同 seed 下可复现。数据合并到 plan_004 的完整 seed=123 结果中。\\n\\n\\nExternal ratio 在 seed=123 下仍全程 >0.95，终值 0.98（略低于 seed=42 的 0.99， 属正常 seed 变异）。Contriever 嵌入冻结不受训练反馈影响，其几何多样性评分 与内容多样性的对齐关系保持稳定。PPL 和 rare 与 seed=42 一致——external 选择 改善 PPL 但不改善 rare。此实验提供 C2-weak 的初步跨 seed 验证。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"三方法 seed=123 完整复现 (GPT2-125M, WikiText-103)\",\n    \"description\": \"3 methods × 8 gens, seed=123。验证 alignment gap ratio 衰减趋势和 RGDS 加速崩塌的可复现性。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"rgds\": {\n        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.01,\n        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 0.97,\n        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 0.94,\n        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 0.89,\n        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 0.86,\n        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 0.88,\n        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 0.82,\n        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.78,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 55.1,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.006,\n        \"gen7_rankme\": 294,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.084,\n        \"rebound_gens\": [\n          5\n        ]\n      },\n      \"uncurated\": {\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 48.5,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.008,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.082\n      },\n      \"external_only\": {\n        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.98,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 46.5,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.008,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.051\n      },\n      \"derived_metrics\": {\n        \"rgds_ppl_excess_vs_uncurated_pct\": 13.6,\n        \"internal_ratio_monotonic\": false,\n        \"internal_ratio_rebound_gens\": [\n          5\n        ],\n        \"cross_seed_internal_ratio_gen7_vs_seed42\": 0.02\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3 (appendix): Seed=123 Full Trajectory\",\n        \"description\": \"与 Table 1 格式相同的完整 gen0-7 轨迹，用于 appendix 展示可复现性。\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C1 跨 seed 可复现性确认：两个 seed 都显示 internal ratio 整体下降（Δ≈-0.23 到 -0.27）， 但反弹位置不同（gen4 vs gen5），进一步支持弱化 \\\"monotonic\\\" 为 \\\"overall trend\\\"。 C2-weak 稳固复现。RGDS PPL excess 跨 seed 一致（12.9% vs 13.6%）。\\n\\n\\nSeed=123 复现了 alignment gap 的整体趋势但反弹发生在 gen5（seed=42 在 gen4）， 终值 0.78 比 seed=42 的 0.76 略高。这属于正常 seed 变异——不同初始化导致 嵌入空间压缩的具体轨迹略有不同，但整体方向一致。RGDS PPL excess 13.6% 与 seed=42 的 12.9% 接近。关键发现：反弹位置的不一致说明 \\\"monotonic\\\" 声明不可持续，但 \\\"overall declining trend\\\" 在两个 seed 间一致。 External ratio 终值 0.98，PPL 和 rare 模式与 seed=42 高度一致。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"三方法 seed=456 完整复现 (GPT2-125M, WikiText-103)\",\n    \"description\": \"3 methods × 8 gens, seed=456。第三个种子，满足统计检验最低要求（3 seeds）。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"rgds\": {\n        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.05,\n        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 1.0,\n        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 0.96,\n        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 0.9,\n        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 0.87,\n        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 0.83,\n        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 0.85,\n        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.8,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 53.8,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.007,\n        \"gen7_rankme\": 293,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.078,\n        \"rebound_gens\": [\n          6\n        ]\n      },\n      \"uncurated\": {\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 47.8,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.009,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.08\n      },\n      \"external_only\": {\n        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 1.0,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 45.8,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.008,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.049\n      },\n      \"derived_metrics\": {\n        \"rgds_ppl_excess_vs_uncurated_pct\": 12.6\n      },\n      \"cross_seed_summary_3seeds\": {\n        \"internal_ratio_gen7_mean\": 0.78,\n        \"internal_ratio_gen7_std\": 0.02,\n        \"external_ratio_gen7_mean\": 0.99,\n        \"external_ratio_gen7_std\": 0.01,\n        \"rgds_ppl_excess_mean_pct\": 13.0,\n        \"rgds_ppl_excess_std_pct\": 0.5,\n        \"rgds_rare_gen7_mean\": 0.0063,\n        \"rgds_rare_gen7_std\": 0.0006,\n        \"uncurated_rare_gen7_mean\": 0.0087,\n        \"uncurated_rare_gen7_std\": 0.0005,\n        \"rank_corr_delta_internal_mean\": -0.06,\n        \"rank_corr_delta_internal_std\": 0.008,\n        \"paired_t_test_internal_vs_external_ratio_p\": 0.003,\n        \"paired_t_test_rgds_vs_uncurated_ppl_p\": 0.02,\n        \"paired_t_test_rgds_vs_uncurated_rare_p\": 0.04\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 3: Cross-Seed Summary Statistics (GPT2-125M, 3 seeds)\",\n        \"description\": \"汇总 3 seeds 的 gen7 关键指标：mean±std + p-value。 internal ratio, external ratio, PPL excess, rare deficit, rank_corr delta。 粗体标注 p<0.05 的行。\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"三 seed 汇总后 C1 的统计基础确立：internal ratio 下降显著（p=0.003）， 但 \\\"monotonic\\\" 声明不可用（三个 seed 反弹位置各异）。 C3 可用但需附 effect size：PPL excess 13.0%（Cohen's d ≈ 1.8，大效应量， 但绝对值不如原始 framing 的 49%），rare deficit 30%（p=0.04，边缘显著）。 C2-weak 是最强的 claim：external ratio 跨 seed 高度一致，p 极显著。 这个汇总表是论文核心 Table，需要放在正文而非 appendix。\\n\\n\\nSeed=456 的反弹出现在 gen6（三个 seed 分别在 gen4/5/6 反弹），终值 0.80。 三个 seed 汇总：internal ratio gen7 均值 0.78±0.02，external 0.99±0.01， 差异显著（paired t-test p=0.003）。RGDS PPL excess 均值 13.0±0.5%， 虽然绝对值不大但跨 seed 一致，p=0.02 显著。 关键 median 特征：rare n-gram 差异 p=0.04——勉强显著（p<0.05 但非 p<0.01）， 这是 median 档的典型表现。rank_corr delta 均值仅 -0.060±0.008， 效应量小但方向一致。三个 seed 都有反弹但位置不同，支持 \\\"overall trend\\\" 叙事但无法声称 \\\"monotonic\\\"。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"GPT2-medium 355M 三方法对比 (WikiText-103, seed=42)\",\n    \"description\": \"验证 alignment gap 在更大模型规模上存在。回应审稿人 \\\"GPT2-125M 太小\\\" 的预期质疑。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"rgds\": {\n        \"gen0_ppl\": 29.3,\n        \"gen1_ppl\": 33.5,\n        \"gen2_ppl\": 37.2,\n        \"gen3_ppl\": 40.1,\n        \"gen4_ppl\": 41.5,\n        \"gen5_ppl\": 42.3,\n        \"gen6_ppl\": 42.8,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 43.2,\n        \"gen0_rare\": 0.031,\n        \"gen1_rare\": 0.021,\n        \"gen2_rare\": 0.015,\n        \"gen3_rare\": 0.012,\n        \"gen4_rare\": 0.01,\n        \"gen5_rare\": 0.009,\n        \"gen6_rare\": 0.008,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.007,\n        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.02,\n        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 0.98,\n        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 0.95,\n        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 0.9,\n        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 0.88,\n        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 0.86,\n        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 0.83,\n        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.8,\n        \"gen0_rankme\": 340,\n        \"gen1_rankme\": 355,\n        \"gen2_rankme\": 362,\n        \"gen3_rankme\": 368,\n        \"gen4_rankme\": 366,\n        \"gen5_rankme\": 361,\n        \"gen6_rankme\": 356,\n        \"gen7_rankme\": 352,\n        \"gen0_rank_corr\": -0.02,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.076,\n        \"rebound_gens\": []\n      },\n      \"uncurated\": {\n        \"gen0_ppl\": 29.0,\n        \"gen1_ppl\": 34.8,\n        \"gen2_ppl\": 39.5,\n        \"gen3_ppl\": 43.2,\n        \"gen4_ppl\": 42.5,\n        \"gen5_ppl\": 40.1,\n        \"gen6_ppl\": 38.2,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 37.8,\n        \"gen0_rare\": 0.031,\n        \"gen1_rare\": 0.021,\n        \"gen2_rare\": 0.016,\n        \"gen3_rare\": 0.013,\n        \"gen4_rare\": 0.011,\n        \"gen5_rare\": 0.011,\n        \"gen6_rare\": 0.01,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.01,\n        \"gen0_rankme\": 342,\n        \"gen7_rankme\": 354,\n        \"gen0_rank_corr\": -0.019,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.072\n      },\n      \"external_only\": {\n        \"gen0_ppl\": 28.8,\n        \"gen1_ppl\": 33.8,\n        \"gen2_ppl\": 38.0,\n        \"gen3_ppl\": 41.0,\n        \"gen4_ppl\": 40.2,\n        \"gen5_ppl\": 38.5,\n        \"gen6_ppl\": 36.8,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 36.5,\n        \"gen0_rare\": 0.031,\n        \"gen1_rare\": 0.021,\n        \"gen2_rare\": 0.015,\n        \"gen3_rare\": 0.012,\n        \"gen4_rare\": 0.011,\n        \"gen5_rare\": 0.01,\n        \"gen6_rare\": 0.009,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.009,\n        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.04,\n        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.98,\n        \"gen0_rank_corr\": -0.019,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.048\n      },\n      \"derived_metrics\": {\n        \"rgds_ppl_excess_vs_uncurated_pct\": 14.3,\n        \"rgds_rare_deficit_vs_uncurated_pct\": -30.0,\n        \"internal_ratio_delta\": -0.22,\n        \"internal_ratio_monotonic\": true,\n        \"note\": \"GPT2-medium 无反弹但斜率更平缓\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4: GPT2-medium Results — Cross-Scale Comparison\",\n        \"description\": \"GPT2-125M vs GPT2-medium 的 gen7 指标并列对比。 重点：ratio Δ、PPL excess %、rare deficit % 跨规模一致性。\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GPT2-medium 确认 alignment gap 跨模型规模存在（R1 reviewer concern 回应）。 但 median 档下需要注意：medium 只有 1 seed，且轨迹比 125M \\\"更好看\\\"（无反弹）， 这可能是 cherry-picking 的风险。论文中需诚实报告 125M 有反弹而 medium 没有， 并解释为模型容量差异。跨规模 PPL excess 一致性（13% vs 14%）是强证据。 medium 的 self-recovery 更强（uncurated PPL 从峰值 43.2 回落到 37.8）， 这可能暗示更大模型的 alignment gap 效应在后期代际会被部分抵消—— 但 rare n-gram 仍然持续下降，再次印证 S1（PPL 和 rare 度量不同崩塌维度）。\\n\\n\\nGPT2-medium 的 alignment gap 效应量略小于 125M（ratio Δ=-0.22 vs -0.27）， 但仍然清晰。更大的模型容量使嵌入空间有更多维度可压缩，压缩过程更平缓， 因此没有出现 125M 的反弹现象——这实际上是好消息，因为 medium 的轨迹 更接近 \\\"monotonic\\\"（但只有一个 seed，不能过度声明）。 PPL excess 14.3% 与 125M 的 13.0% 接近，说明 alignment gap 的相对效应 跨模型规模一致。Rare n-gram 下降幅度也相似（-30% vs -33%）。 RankMe 基线更高（340 vs 281，符合更大模型预期）但同样与 rare 反向变动。 关键限制：uncurated gen7 PPL 37.8 比 gen0 的 29.0 高 30%，说明 self-iterate 崩塌在 medium 上也存在，只是 PPL 最终回落更多（medium 的 self-recovery 更强）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"GPT2-medium 355M seed=123 复现\",\n    \"description\": \"GPT2-medium 多 seed 验证，确认 355M 规模下 alignment gap 可复现。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"rgds\": {\n        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.82,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 44.0,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.007,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.072,\n        \"rebound_gens\": [\n          5\n        ]\n      },\n      \"uncurated\": {\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 38.5,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.01\n      },\n      \"external_only\": {\n        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.97,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 37.2,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.009\n      },\n      \"derived_metrics\": {\n        \"rgds_ppl_excess_vs_uncurated_pct\": 14.3,\n        \"note\": \"seed=123 在 medium 上出现 gen5 微弱反弹（ratio 0.85→0.87），但整体趋势一致\"\n      },\n      \"cross_scale_cross_seed_summary\": {\n        \"gpt2_125m_internal_ratio_gen7_mean_2seeds\": 0.77,\n        \"gpt2_medium_internal_ratio_gen7_mean_2seeds\": 0.81,\n        \"ratio_gap_between_scales\": 0.04,\n        \"interpretation\": \"medium 终值略高但差异不大，alignment gap 跨规模稳健\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 4 (扩展): 跨模型跨 seed 汇总\",\n        \"description\": \"2 模型 × 2-3 seeds 的 gen7 关键指标矩阵。 标注哪些 seed 有反弹、反弹位置。\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Medium 跨 seed 验证成功但样本量有限（只有 2 seeds vs 125M 的 3 seeds）。 论文中需注明 medium 实验为初步验证（\\\"preliminary evidence of scale generalization\\\"）， 不做过强声明。Combined evidence：5 个独立实验（125M×3 + medium×2）全部 显示 internal ratio 下降，终值范围 0.76-0.82，external 终值 0.97-1.00。 这足以支持 Findings paper。\\n\\n\\nSeed=123 在 medium 上出现一次微弱反弹（gen5，ratio +0.02）， 而 seed=42 无反弹——进一步说明反弹是 seed-dependent noise，不是系统性信号。 Medium 两 seed 内部 ratio 终值分别 0.80 和 0.82（125M 为 0.76 和 0.78）， 差异 ~0.04，说明更大模型的 gap 略小但方向一致。 PPL excess 14.3% 与 seed=42 完全一致，跨 seed 稳定性比 125M 更好 （可能因为 medium 训练更稳定）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Embedding re-anchoring 缓解实验 (GPT2-125M, seed=42)\",\n    \"description\": \"每 K 代（K=3）用原始预训练权重重新计算选择嵌入（不改训练过程，只改 selection 用的嵌入）。 测试 alignment gap 是否可通过简单手段修复。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"reanchored\": {\n        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.03,\n        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 0.98,\n        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 0.93,\n        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 1.01,\n        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 0.96,\n        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 0.91,\n        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 0.98,\n        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.93,\n        \"gen0_ppl\": 37.2,\n        \"gen1_ppl\": 41.8,\n        \"gen2_ppl\": 46.5,\n        \"gen3_ppl\": 49.8,\n        \"gen4_ppl\": 51.3,\n        \"gen5_ppl\": 52.1,\n        \"gen6_ppl\": 50.5,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 51.8,\n        \"gen0_rare\": 0.029,\n        \"gen1_rare\": 0.018,\n        \"gen2_rare\": 0.012,\n        \"gen3_rare\": 0.01,\n        \"gen4_rare\": 0.008,\n        \"gen5_rare\": 0.007,\n        \"gen6_rare\": 0.007,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.0065,\n        \"gen0_rank_corr\": -0.024,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.082\n      },\n      \"comparison_vs_rgds\": {\n        \"ppl_improvement_pct\": 4.4,\n        \"rare_improvement_pct\": 8.3,\n        \"selection_ratio_gen7_improvement\": 0.17\n      },\n      \"statistical_tests\": {\n        \"ppl_diff_significant\": false,\n        \"rare_diff_significant\": false,\n        \"ratio_recovery_significant\": true,\n        \"ppl_p_value\": 0.12,\n        \"rare_p_value\": 0.31,\n        \"note\": \"ratio 恢复显著但下游指标改善不显著\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5 (appendix): Re-anchoring vs RGDS vs Uncurated\",\n        \"description\": \"三行（RGDS/re-anchored/uncurated）× gen7 关键指标 + p-value。 标注 re-anchored ratio 显著恢复但 PPL/rare 不显著。\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Re-anchoring 产生了一个有趣但不足以升级论文的结果：ratio 恢复证明 alignment gap 确实是可诊断的（验证了 C1 的因果方向），但下游不改善说明 gap 只是崩塌链条的一环。 这个结果对 Findings paper 来说反而是好事——如果 re-anchoring 完全解决了问题， 审稿人会期望更大的实验矩阵；现在 re-anchoring 失败，\\\"开放问题\\\" 的定位更自然。 移入 appendix，1 段讨论 + 2 张 appendix 图。 论文正文加一句：\\\"Simple embedding re-anchoring restores selection ratio but does not translate to downstream diversity improvement (Appendix B), suggesting the root cause lies in the generation process rather than the selection process.\\\"\\n\\n\\nRe-anchoring 成功恢复了 selection ratio 的短期表现（每次 re-anchor 后 ratio 跳回 ~1.0），但恢复是暂时的——ratio 在每个 K-step 周期内又迅速下降。 终值 0.93 显著优于 RGDS 的 0.76（ratio 恢复显著），但下游指标改善有限： PPL 改善仅 4.4%（51.8 vs 54.2，p=0.12 不显著），rare 改善 8.3% （0.0065 vs 0.006，p=0.31 不显著）。\\n根本原因：re-anchoring 解决了\\\"用错误的嵌入选数据\\\"的问题（ratio 恢复）， 但没有解决\\\"self-iterate 训练本身导致模型生成同质化内容\\\"的根本问题。 选出的数据在 gen0 嵌入空间中看起来多样，但模型已经往同质化方向漂移， 再训练仍然会压缩嵌入空间。这就是为什么 ratio 能恢复但 rare 不能—— 问题在生成端（模型已经不会生成 rare tokens），不在选择端。\\nMedian 档预测 reanchoring_rare_improvement_pct 在 [-5, 10] 范围， 此处 8.3% 位于上界附近但 p>0.05，不具统计意义。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"OpenWebText 子集 三方法对比 (GPT2-125M, seed=42)\",\n    \"description\": \"验证 alignment gap 跨数据集存在。回应 \\\"WikiText-103 是否特殊\\\" 的质疑。 使用 OpenWebText 随机 50K 子集。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"rgds\": {\n        \"gen0_ppl\": 28.5,\n        \"gen1_ppl\": 32.8,\n        \"gen2_ppl\": 37.1,\n        \"gen3_ppl\": 40.3,\n        \"gen4_ppl\": 42.0,\n        \"gen5_ppl\": 43.1,\n        \"gen6_ppl\": 43.6,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 44.0,\n        \"gen0_rare\": 0.025,\n        \"gen1_rare\": 0.016,\n        \"gen2_rare\": 0.011,\n        \"gen3_rare\": 0.008,\n        \"gen4_rare\": 0.007,\n        \"gen5_rare\": 0.006,\n        \"gen6_rare\": 0.0055,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.005,\n        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.04,\n        \"gen1_selection_ratio\": 0.99,\n        \"gen2_selection_ratio\": 0.94,\n        \"gen3_selection_ratio\": 0.88,\n        \"gen4_selection_ratio\": 0.85,\n        \"gen5_selection_ratio\": 0.82,\n        \"gen6_selection_ratio\": 0.79,\n        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 0.74,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.095,\n        \"rebound_gens\": []\n      },\n      \"uncurated\": {\n        \"gen0_ppl\": 28.2,\n        \"gen1_ppl\": 34.1,\n        \"gen2_ppl\": 39.8,\n        \"gen3_ppl\": 44.5,\n        \"gen4_ppl\": 43.8,\n        \"gen5_ppl\": 41.2,\n        \"gen6_ppl\": 38.9,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 38.5,\n        \"gen0_rare\": 0.025,\n        \"gen1_rare\": 0.017,\n        \"gen2_rare\": 0.012,\n        \"gen3_rare\": 0.01,\n        \"gen4_rare\": 0.009,\n        \"gen5_rare\": 0.008,\n        \"gen6_rare\": 0.008,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.007,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.081\n      },\n      \"external_only\": {\n        \"gen0_ppl\": 27.9,\n        \"gen1_ppl\": 33.0,\n        \"gen2_ppl\": 38.2,\n        \"gen3_ppl\": 41.5,\n        \"gen4_ppl\": 40.8,\n        \"gen5_ppl\": 38.9,\n        \"gen6_ppl\": 37.0,\n        \"gen7_ppl\": 36.8,\n        \"gen0_rare\": 0.025,\n        \"gen1_rare\": 0.016,\n        \"gen2_rare\": 0.012,\n        \"gen3_rare\": 0.01,\n        \"gen4_rare\": 0.009,\n        \"gen5_rare\": 0.008,\n        \"gen6_rare\": 0.007,\n        \"gen7_rare\": 0.007,\n        \"gen0_selection_ratio\": 1.06,\n        \"gen7_selection_ratio\": 1.01,\n        \"gen7_rank_corr\": -0.05\n      },\n      \"derived_metrics\": {\n        \"rgds_ppl_excess_vs_uncurated_pct\": 14.3,\n        \"rgds_rare_deficit_vs_uncurated_pct\": -28.6,\n        \"note\": \"OWT 基线 PPL 更低（GPT2 预训练数据包含 web text），rare 基线也更低（更标准化的文本）\"\n      },\n      \"cross_dataset_comparison\": {\n        \"wikitext_rgds_ppl_excess_pct\": 13.0,\n        \"owt_rgds_ppl_excess_pct\": 14.3,\n        \"wikitext_internal_ratio_gen7\": 0.78,\n        \"owt_internal_ratio_gen7\": 0.74,\n        \"consistency\": \"方向和量级一致，OWT 上 gap 略大（可能因 OWT 文本更同质化）\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Table 5: Cross-Dataset Comparison (WikiText-103 vs OpenWebText)\",\n        \"description\": \"两数据集 gen7 指标并列：internal ratio, external ratio, PPL excess %, rare deficit %, rank_corr delta。最后一列标注一致性（✓/✗）。\\n\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"OWT 验证是 median 档论文能否投 Findings 的关键实验之一。跨数据集一致性 直接回应 R2 reviewer concern。OWT 上 gap 略大这个发现本身可以讨论—— 更同质化的数据源可能让嵌入空间压缩更快。但因为 OWT 只有 1 seed， 不能做过强的跨数据集对比声明。论文中用 \\\"consistent pattern across both datasets\\\" 的措辞，不量化差异的显著性。 如果时间不够，这个实验是 P1 可以砍掉的——但砍掉后审稿人 R2 concern 会更难回应，论文可能降为 workshop paper。\\n\\nOpenWebText 上 alignment gap 同样存在，且效应量略大于 WikiText-103 （ratio 终值 0.74 vs 0.78，PPL excess 14.3% vs 13.0%）。OWT 没有反弹—— 这可能因为 OWT 文本分布本身更均匀（web crawl vs curated Wikipedia）， 导致嵌入空间压缩更平滑。OWT 基线 PPL 更低（28.2 vs 37.0）因为 GPT2 预训练数据包含大量 web text，domain 更接近。\\nRare n-gram 基线也更低（0.025 vs 0.029），反映 OWT 文本本身的词汇多样性 低于 WikiText（web text 更口语化，rare token 更少）。但 rare 的下降比例 与 WikiText 一致（-80% vs -79%），说明崩塌机制是数据集无关的。\\nExternal selection ratio 终值 1.01（WikiText 0.99），都在 >0.95 范围内。 跨数据集一致性是 Findings paper 的重要支撑——单数据集发现的可信度受限， 两个数据集的一致结果显著增强说服力。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":571,"startLine":1,"totalLines":571}}}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Rc6juZ5xsxtCuzzeDzGY8k","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Paper Framing — Embedding Alignment Gap\n2\t\n3\t## Target Venue\n4\tEMNLP 2026 ARR (deadline: May 25, 2026) — Findings full paper (8 pages)\n5\t\n6\t## Title (working)\n7\t\"The Embedding Alignment Gap: Why Diversity-Based Data Selection Accelerates Model Collapse in Iterative Self-Training\"\n8\t\n9\t## Core Insight\n10\tIn iterative self-training (student-as-generator feedback loop), the geometric diversity of a model's internal embeddings becomes systematically misaligned with content diversity (measured by rare n-gram survival). This \"alignment gap\" worsens monotonically across generations, causing diversity-based data selection using internal representations to **accelerate** rather than prevent model collapse. Frozen external embeddings (e.g., Contriever) are immune to this misalignment.\n11\t\n12\t## Core Claims\n13\t\n14\t### C1: Alignment Gap Exists and Worsens Monotonically\n15\t- Internal embedding diversity selection ratio degrades from ~1.04 (Gen 0) to ~0.52 (Gen 7)\n16\t- The model increasingly selects vocabulary-poor samples when using its own representations for diversity scoring\n17\t- Evidence: Phase 2 RGDS selection diagnostics (GPT2-125M, WikiText-103, self-iterate)\n18\t\n19\t### C2-weak: Frozen External Embeddings Are Immune to the Gap\n20\t- Contriever-based selection maintains ratio >1.1 across all generations (1.14→1.28 through Gen 4)\n21\t- External embeddings improve model quality (PPL -6.5% vs uncurated) but do NOT improve rare n-gram survival\n22\t- This is a comparative claim: external embeddings \"don't make the mistake\" internal ones make, not a solution to vocabulary collapse\n23\t- The dissociation between PPL improvement and rare n-gram stagnation itself is an interesting finding\n24\t\n25\t### C3: The Gap Causes Accelerated Collapse\n26\t- RGDS (internal diversity selection) produces PPL 75.07 vs uncurated 50.28 (+49%) and rare n-gram 0.0051 vs 0.0090 (-43%)\n27\t- Complete causal chain: embedding space contracts → \"geometrically diverse\" = \"vocabulary-poor\" → selection amplifies homogeneity → accelerated collapse\n28\t\n29\t## Secondary Claims\n30\t\n31\t### S1: PPL and Rare N-gram Measure Different Collapse Dimensions\n32\t- External selection improves PPL (-6.5%) without improving rare n-gram survival\n33\t- Selection ratio >1.1 translates to PPL gains but not vocabulary diversity gains\n34\t- Implication: semantic diversity ≠ lexical diversity in the context of iterative distillation\n35\t\n36\t### S2: Representation Quality Metrics Don't Detect Diversity Collapse\n37\t- RankMe increases during collapse (280→303, +8%)\n38\t- k-NN probe accuracy stable (0.988 throughout)\n39\t- These metrics track representation structure, not content diversity — a cautionary finding for monitoring frameworks\n40\t\n41\t## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n42\t\n43\t### R1: \"GPT2-125M is too small — does this generalize?\"\n44\t- Response: GPT2-medium (355M) experiments planned; alignment gap mechanism (embedding space contraction under self-iterate) is architecture-general\n45\t- If GPT2-medium shows gap: \"scales beyond toy models\"\n46\t\n47\t### R2: \"Only one dataset (WikiText-103)\"\n48\t- Response: OpenWebText subset planned as P1\n49\t- The mechanism is data-agnostic (self-iterate collapse is well-documented across datasets)\n50\t\n51\t### R3: \"N=1 seed — is this noise?\"\n52\t- Response: 3 seeds per configuration planned; the monotonic trend over 8 generations (not a single-point measurement) reduces seed sensitivity concern\n53\t- seed=123 already running as replication\n54\t\n55\t### R4: \"You only found a problem, not a solution\"\n56\t- Response: (a) Embedding re-anchoring experiment planned as simple mitigation; (b) the finding itself has immediate practical value — practitioners should avoid internal-embedding-based curation during iterative training\n57\t- If re-anchoring works → upgrade to \"found + solved\"\n58\t\n59\t### R5: \"What's the theoretical explanation for the gap?\"\n60\t- Connect to neural collapse literature (Papyan et al. 2020): self-iterate reduces intra-class variability → embedding effective dimensionality drops → greedy submodular selection in low-dim space favors collapsed mode directions\n61\t- Not a formal proof, but a plausible mechanistic intuition with empirical support\n62\t\n63\t### R6: \"External embeddings don't improve rare n-gram — how is C2 useful?\"\n64\t- C2 is comparative: shows the gap is specific to internal embeddings under training feedback, not an inherent property of embedding-based selection\n65\t- PPL improvement shows external selection captures meaningful diversity (semantic level), even if not lexical level\n66\t- Opens future work: what selection signal DOES preserve lexical diversity?\n67\t\n68\t## Narrative Arc\n69\t1. **Setup**: Iterative self-training causes model collapse (established). Diversity-based data curation is a natural mitigation idea.\n70\t2. **Surprise**: Using the model's own representations for diversity selection makes collapse WORSE, not better.\n71\t3. **Explanation**: The Embedding Alignment Gap — internal representations' notion of \"diverse\" diverges from content diversity as training progresses.\n72\t4. **Contrast**: Frozen external embeddings don't suffer this misalignment (but also don't solve vocabulary collapse).\n73\t5. **Implication**: Embedding-based diversity selection is unreliable in iterative settings; the field needs vocabulary-aware alternatives.\n74\t\n75\t## Related Work Positioning\n76\t- Model collapse: Shumailov et al. (Nature 2024), Alemohammad et al. (2024), Dohmatob et al. (2024)\n77\t- Data selection/curation: SemDeDup (Abbas 2023), D4 (Tirumala 2023), DSIR (Xie 2023) — these use external embeddings for static (non-iterative) curation; we show iterative setting introduces new failure mode\n78\t- Neural collapse: Papyan et al. (2020) — theoretical grounding for why embeddings lose diversity signal\n79\t- Representation quality metrics: RankMe (Garrido et al. 2023) — we show RankMe doesn't detect diversity collapse\n80\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0bbf4eb3-b4da-441c-9b01-1494e5d0d8cb","uuid":"dc2e5180-61eb-4bb7-902c-393c003e18bd","timestamp":"2026-05-13T08:37:56.388Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_4/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260513T081019/median/paper_framing.md","content":"# Paper Framing — Embedding Alignment Gap\n\n## Target Venue\nEMNLP 2026 ARR (deadline: May 25, 2026) — Findings full paper (8 pages)\n\n## Title (working)\n\"The Embedding Alignment Gap: Why Diversity-Based Data Selection Accelerates Model Collapse in Iterative Self-Training\"\n\n## Core Insight\nIn iterative self-training (student-as-generator feedback loop), the geometric diversity of a model's internal embeddings becomes systematically misaligned with content diversity (measured by rare n-gram survival). This \"alignment gap\" worsens monotonically across generations, causing diversity-based data selection using internal representations to **accelerate** rather than prevent model collapse. Frozen external embeddings (e.g., Contriever) are immune to this misalignment.\n\n## Core Claims\n\n### C1: Alignment Gap Exists and Worsens Monotonically\n- Internal embedding diversity selection ratio degrades from ~1.04 (Gen 0) to ~0.52 (Gen 7)\n- The model increasingly selects vocabulary-poor samples when using its own representations for diversity scoring\n- Evidence: Phase 2 RGDS selection diagnostics (GPT2-125M, WikiText-103, self-iterate)\n\n### C2-weak: Frozen External Embeddings Are Immune to the Gap\n- Contriever-based selection maintains ratio >1.1 across all generations (1.14→1.28 through Gen 4)\n- External embeddings improve model quality (PPL -6.5% vs uncurated) but do NOT improve rare n-gram survival\n- This is a comparative claim: external embeddings \"don't make the mistake\" internal ones make, not a solution to vocabulary collapse\n- The dissociation between PPL improvement and rare n-gram stagnation itself is an interesting finding\n\n### C3: The Gap Causes Accelerated Collapse\n- RGDS (internal diversity selection) produces PPL 75.07 vs uncurated 50.28 (+49%) and rare n-gram 0.0051 vs 0.0090 (-43%)\n- Complete causal chain: embedding space contracts → \"geometrically diverse\" = \"vocabulary-poor\" → selection amplifies homogeneity → accelerated collapse\n\n## Secondary Claims\n\n### S1: PPL and Rare N-gram Measure Different Collapse Dimensions\n- External selection improves PPL (-6.5%) without improving rare n-gram survival\n- Selection ratio >1.1 translates to PPL gains but not vocabulary diversity gains\n- Implication: semantic diversity ≠ lexical diversity in the context of iterative distillation\n\n### S2: Representation Quality Metrics Don't Detect Diversity Collapse\n- RankMe increases during collapse (280→303, +8%)\n- k-NN probe accuracy stable (0.988 throughout)\n- These metrics track representation structure, not content diversity — a cautionary finding for monitoring frameworks\n\n## Anticipated Reviewer Concerns\n\n### R1: \"GPT2-125M is too small — does this generalize?\"\n- Response: GPT2-medium (355M) experiments planned; alignment gap mechanism (embedding space contraction under self-iterate) is architecture-general\n- If GPT2-medium shows gap: \"scales beyond toy models\"\n\n### R2: \"Only one dataset (WikiText-103)\"\n- Response: OpenWebText subset planned as P1\n- The mechanism is data-agnostic (self-iterate collapse is well-documented across datasets)\n\n### R3: \"N=1 seed — is this noise?\"\n- Response: 3 seeds per configuration planned; the monotonic trend over 8 generations (not a single-point measurement) reduces seed sensitivity concern\n- seed=123 already running as replication\n\n### R4: \"You only found a problem, not a solution\"\n- Response: (a) Embedding re-anchoring experiment planned as simple mitigation; (b) the finding itself has immediate practical value — practitioners should avoid internal-embedding-based curation during iterative training\n- If re-anchoring works → upgrade to \"found + solved\"\n\n### R5: \"What's the theoretical explanation for the gap?\"\n- Connect to neural collapse literature (Papyan et al. 2020): self-iterate reduces intra-class variability → embedding effective dimensionality drops → greedy submodular selection in low-dim space favors collapsed mode directions\n- Not a formal proof, but a plausible mechanistic intuition with empirical support\n\n### R6: \"External embeddings don't improve rare n-gram — how is C2 useful?\"\n- C2 is comparative: shows the gap is specific to internal embeddings under training feedback, not an inherent property of embedding-based selection\n- PPL improvement shows external selection captures meaningful diversity (semantic level), even if not lexical level\n- Opens future work: what selection signal DOES preserve lexical diversity?\n\n## Narrative Arc\n1. **Setup**: Iterative self-training causes model collapse (established). Diversity-based data curation is a natural mitigation idea.\n2. **Surprise**: Using the model's own representations for diversity selection makes collapse WORSE, not better.\n3. **Explanation**: The Embedding Alignment Gap — internal representations' notion of \"diverse\" diverges from content diversity as training progresses.\n4. **Contrast**: Frozen external embeddings don't suffer this misalignment (but also don't solve vocabulary collapse).\n5. **Implication**: Embedding-based diversity selection is unreliable in iterative settings; the field needs vocabulary-aware alternatives.\n\n## Related Work Positioning\n- Model collapse: Shumailov et al. (Nature 2024), Alemohammad et al. (2024), Dohmatob et al. (2024)\n- Data selection/curation: SemDeDup (Abbas 2023), D4 (Tirumala 2023), DSIR (Xie 2023) — these use external embeddings for static (non-iterative) curation; we show iterative setting introduces new failure mode\n- Neural collapse: Papyan et al. (2020) — theoretical grounding for why embeddings lose diversity signal\n- Representation quality metrics: RankMe (Garrido et al. 2023) — we show RankMe doesn't detect diversity collapse\n","numLines":80,"startLine":1,"totalLines":80}}}
